Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.23,0:30:47.26,DCMain,,0,0,0,,{\be1}بعد إذنكم
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.25,0:30:54.10,DCMain,,0,0,0,,{\be1}!ما هذا؟
